==Battleground==
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A stage with very easily handled traits; in-fact, you will likely be able to field multiple Cats that target both or even all three of the traits/sub-traits. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] can deal with almost everything here, and [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]] can snipe the Professor A. and deal additional damage. The start off is generous with 5 B.B.Bunnies, but farming them is generally not necessary. If extra attackers are needed, other trait counters like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] work well.

